## Common Use Cases

### 1. Route Documentation Generation

```go
var routes []RouteInfo

app.Hooks().OnRoute(func(r fiber.Route) error {
    routes = append(routes, RouteInfo{
        Method: r.Method,
        Path:   r.Path,
        Name:   r.Name,
    })
    return nil
})

// After all routes defined, generate docs
generateSwaggerDocs(routes)
```

### 2. Naming Convention Enforcement

```go
app.Hooks().OnName(func(r fiber.Route) error {
    // Enforce format: "module.resource.action"
    parts := strings.Split(r.Name, ".")
    if len(parts) != 3 {
        return fmt.Errorf("route name %s doesn't follow convention", r.Name)
    }
    return nil
})
```

### 3. Service Registration

```go
app.Hooks().OnListen(func(data fiber.ListenData) error {
    // Register with service discovery
    return consul.Register(ServiceInfo{
        Name: "galaxy-pay-api",
        Host: data.Host,
        Port: data.Port,
    })
})
```

### 4. Lifecycle Logging

```go
app.Hooks().OnRoute(func(r fiber.Route) error {
    log.Printf("[ROUTE] %s %s", r.Method, r.Path)
    return nil
})

app.Hooks().OnListen(func(data fiber.ListenData) error {
    log.Printf("[LISTEN] %s://%s:%s", data.Scheme, data.Host, data.Port)
    return nil
})

app.Hooks().OnShutdown(func() error {
    log.Printf("[SHUTDOWN] Server stopped")
    return nil
})
```

